# Partition / storage layout capture - JioRouter AX6000 JIDU6801
# Source: UART0 serial console, 115200 8N1, cold boot of the STOCK
# firmware on this unit. Identifiers redacted by tools/sanitize-log.py.
#
# SCOPE: this is the vendor stock kernel (5.4.225), not the OpenWrt build
# produced by this repository. It is published because it is the
# authoritative on-hardware record of the physical MTD partition layout,
# NMBM region and switch/PHY inventory. Note the stock names it 'mfg'
# (lowercase) where the OpenWrt device tree uses 'MFG' for the same
# 2 MiB region at 0x0eb80000.
#
